  "reasoning": "The facts describe the establishment of a company and a website that attracted members by promising high returns and required them to pay a deposit. Members were then required to recruit new members, forming a multi‑level network. The defendant organized and led this scheme, profiting from the fees paid by members and their downline. This conduct constitutes the crime of organizing and leading a pyramid selling (传销) activity, which is punishable under the Criminal Law of the People’s Republic of China.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]组织、领导传销活动<eoa>"
}
